<view class="cart-page">
  <view wx:if="{{!cart}}" class="cart-empty"><view class="cart-empty__mark">篮</view><text>购物车还是空的</text><text>从当前收货区域正在收单的商品里挑几件吧。</text><navigator open-type="switchTab" url="/pages/home/index">去逛团购</navigator></view>
  <block wx:else><view class="cart-context"><view><text>{{cart.campaignTitle}}</text><text>{{cart.pickupPointName}} · {{cart.pickupPointAddress}}</text></view><text bindtap="clearAll">清空</text></view><view wx:if="{{areaMismatch}}" class="cart-warning">当前固定自提点与购物车不一致，请切回该自提点或清空后重新选购。</view><view class="cart-list"><view wx:for="{{cart.items}}" wx:key="skuId" class="cart-line"><image src="{{item.imageUrl || '/assets/product-rice-noodles.jpg'}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="cart-line__copy"><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.skuName}}</text><text class="money">{{item.priceText}}</text></view><view class="cart-line__tools"><text class="remove" data-id="{{item.skuId}}" bindtap="removeLine">删除</text><view class="qty"><text data-id="{{item.skuId}}" data-step="-1" bindtap="changeQuantity">−</text><text>{{item.quantity}}</text><text data-id="{{item.skuId}}" data-step="1" bindtap="changeQuantity">＋</text></view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{count > 0}}" class="cart-bar"><view><text>共 {{count}} 件</text><text class="money">{{total}}</text></view><button class="primary-button" disabled="{{areaMismatch}}" bindtap="checkout">去结算</button></view></block>
</view>
